Z||000001||Carrolles||12-19-2000||06:51 AM||||Don't have any idea about the GrandPrix writeup but the aftermarket Cruise from JC Whitney is easy to install and looks just like the original inside the car.  Wiring involves a connection to the brake lights, speed sonsor, power, and tach.<P>Look for the unit that uses a VSS signal, not the one that uses magnets on the drive shaft.  It'll run around $125.||||reg||1
